Dispatch generated, but not handed over: A department may have generated the tracking number, but the physical letter has not yet been handed to India Post.

Booking not updated: The letter may have been handed over, but the booking information has not yet appeared in the tracking system.

Tracking number discrepancy: The number may have been entered or generated incorrectly.

